CinnabarVolcano_LeftCorridor_2F_Text_GarrettIntro::
    .string "A volcano's just a mountain\n"
    .string "with a temper!$"

CinnabarVolcano_LeftCorridor_2F_Text_GarrettDefeat::
    .string "That shook me loose!$"

CinnabarVolcano_LeftCorridor_2F_Text_GarrettPostBattle::
    .string "Loose stone, hot air, and hard\n"
    .string "climbs. That's a real trail.$"

CinnabarVolcano_LeftCorridor_2F_Text_KogaCheckpoint::
    .string "KOGA: Fwahahaha!\p"
    .string "You kept pace through the heat\n"
    .string "and stone.\p"
    .string "Good.\n"
    .string "The water source lies deeper still.\p"
    .string "A ninja does not simply rush\n"
    .string "toward the goal.\p"
    .string "We watch the path, trust our allies,\n"
    .string "and move as one.$"
